                "text": "In order to meet the nutrition needs of the world, it is vital to protect our farmers, encourage young and first-generation farmers to carry on the tradition, and invest in agricultural research. \n\nThe farm bill is not just for farmers but for America\u2019s future. https://t.co/A6Djeltvrb",
